WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:15.209
Jeremy paddled the boat across the pond.

2
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.790
Rain poured down.

3
00:00:23.568 --> 00:00:29.199
"Oh no," Tom said. "I'm getting wet!"

4
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.099
Jeremy put on a raincoat.

5
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.700
But Tom didn't have a raincoat.

6
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.480
Then Tom spotted a pail.

7
00:00:44.332 --> 00:00:47.479
He put it on his head.

8
00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:52.370
Tom smiled. "Now I will stay dry!"

9
00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:57.410
Suddenly Tom felt something slimy.

10
00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.330
A worm slid down Tom's face.

11
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:06.320
Another one crawled along his arm.

12
00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.360
Worms climbed into his pocket.

13
00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:14.640
Tom laughed. "Worms are funny!"

14
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.320
Jeremy stopped paddling and frowned.

15
00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.180
"Tom! Those worms are for fishing!"

16
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.160
Tom gave Jeremy some worms.

17
00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.890
Jeremy put a worm on his hook.

18
00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:44.250
Jeremy and Tom waited for a while.

19
00:01:44.668 --> 00:01:52.769
The rain stopped.

20
00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:56.661
"Where are all the fish?" Tom asked.

21
00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.230
Jeremy laughed. "In the water."

22
00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.690
Tom sighed.

23
00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.703
"Fishing is boring," he thought.

24
00:02:15.704 --> 00:02:19.580
"And I need to find Mother's flowers."

25
00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.700
Thump. Thump.

26
00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:24.883
Something bumped into the boat.

27
00:02:24.884 --> 00:02:26.786
Tom jumped.

28
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.460
"What was that?" he said.
